From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adithya R <gh0strider.2k18.reborn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Oct 2022 23:07:22 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 11/19] debuggerd: use jemalloc by default and allow opt-in to
 scudo (4/4)

Since we have switched to jemalloc (bionic).

Change-Id: Ie89f9a7be4e965abf346402084a2a2d032771d3e
Signed-off-by: Gustavo Mendes <gusttavo.me@outlook.com>
Signed-off-by: Juhyung Park <qkrwngud825@gmail.com>
---
 debuggerd/Android.bp | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/debuggerd/Android.bp b/debuggerd/Android.bp
index fe2b055..99ba58c 100644
--- a/debuggerd/Android.bp
+++ b/debuggerd/Android.bp
@@ -324,6 +324,11 @@ cc_library_static {
             cflags: ["-UUSE_SCUDO"],
             exclude_static_libs: ["libscudo"],
         },
+
+        malloc_use_jemalloc: {
+            cflags: ["-UUSE_SCUDO"],
+            exclude_static_libs: ["libscudo"],
+        },
     },
     apex_available: [
         "com.android.runtime",
